      "typical_award_size": "One-time allocations by Board action rather than a program: $1,500,000 approved August 8, 2023 to Visionary Home Builders for a 94-unit senior and family development in Downtown Stockton (TDC $60,518,336, leveraging about $34 million in state tax credits with HCD Infill Infrastructure Grant, City of Stockton HOME and a City impact fee waiver). The County has no housing trust fund, no housing bond and no dedicated housing revenue; the 2023-2031 Housing Element and the SJCOG feasibility study point to the regional fund as the vehicle instead.",
